                "Binary machine opcodes",
                "Only file comments and copyright notices"
              ],
              "question": "What symbol types does the polyglot AST parser extract from Protobuf definitions?"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Module 3: Apache Tika 4.0 Streaming tika-grpc Architecture & Polyglot AST Parsing"
        },
        {
          "durationMinutes": 10,
          "id": "mod-04-buildbarn-rbe",
          "labSteps": [
            "Generate Buildbarn Helm values.yaml using POST /api/v1/rbe/values or lib/buildbarn-rbe.js",
