          "overview": "Bridge parsed nodes into the high-performance Luxir C++ search index on port 8983, execute faceted sub-millisecond CLI queries, and validate all nodes through W3C SHACL constraint shape gates before committing to the Knowledge Graph.",
          "quiz": [
