          "overview": "Deep dive into the autonomous InfinityAIAgent (qa_player/infinity_ai_agent.py): 140px spatial threat radar, 200px pack alerting, combined-arms tactics (tank intercept, rogue standoff kiting, wizard Magic Missile priority, cleric Cure Wounds <40% HP), and headless Xvfb :99 execution with 1080p FFmpeg video proof-of-work.",
          "quiz": [
